  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Buna-S is a copolymer of 1,3-butadiene and styrene. It is prepared by copolymerisation of 1,3 butadiene and styrene along with sodium.&nbsp;In this process peroxide is used as a catalyst at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;therefore the formed product is also known as cold rubber.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/68f0e126-7a1e-49dc-91db-a4388494dd78-1ed3be76-2287-49b9-a553-40cd925c96d5-image.png\" style=\"width: 626px; height: 130px;\" /></p>",
